        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_worth = 1_200_000\n    residency_factor = 0.9\n\n    tax_free_threshold = 500_000\n    second_threshold = 1_000_000\n    second_rate = 0.02\n    top_rate = 0.04\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    second_bracket_tax = (second_threshold - tax_free_threshold) * second_rate\n    top_bracket_tax = (net_worth - second_threshold) * top_rate\n    total_tax = second_bracket_tax + top_bracket_tax\n    adjusted_tax = total_tax * residency_factor\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(adjusted_tax)\n```",
